      {
        "startMs": 500,
        "endMs": 2420,
        "text": "Welcome to generative software engineering."
      },
      {
        "startMs": 2750,
        "endMs": 7070,
        "text": "Today we look at prompts, e.g. how a model reads them."
      },
      {
        "startMs": 7400,
        "endMs": 16520,
        "text": "The first thing to notice is that a prompt is not a magic spell but a specification that the model tries to satisfy,"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 16970,
        "endMs": 27540,
        "text": "and like every specification it can be vague, contradictory or incomplete in ways that only show up when you run it so that is the idea"
      },
      {
        "startMs": 28820,
        "endMs": 31940,
        "text": "and then we move on to the tools"
      }
    ]
  },
